# House: raises the POPULATION cap of the nearest built own-team barracks within "House link
# radius" ("House population" each; one barracks per house, re-derived every tick). No power, no
# grid role; just population that dies with it. On a 4x3x4 m box (2x2 cells).
# Spawned origin 1.5 above the ground hit.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): plastered walls (the root) under a
# stepped timber roof. The child pieces are render-only.
Prefab gameHouse
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node CubeHalf
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.8 0.72 0.56
		Position 0 -0.55 0
		Scale 1.9
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 1.5 2
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 2
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Roof
			Position 0 0.9 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeQuarter
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.36 0.25 0.15
				Scale 2.1
		Entity
			Name RoofTop
			Position 0 1.5 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer baseshapes
				Node CubeQuarter
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 0.3 0.21 0.13
				Scale 1.2
